                "entry_id": "1789c072-2c56-33f9-9011-ca54d613d4ac",
                "word": "mitnichten",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "de",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                        "entry_id": "1789c072-2c56-33f9-9011-ca54d613d4ac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "auf keinen Fall, in keiner Weise"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "gehoben",
                            "outdated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b498e45-bd24-4390-9039-d83003dafe7e",
                                "sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                                "text": "„Der Ruhm stieg aber Annette nicht zu Kopf; ihre Freundin Sibylle vergaß sie darüber mitnichten.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe24df42-fc96-4961-97f7-779a304c023c",
                                "sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                                "text": "„Die meisten Paare schlafen mitnichten miteinander aus der kühlen Berechnung heraus, Kinder zeugen zu wollen; sie vermehren sich eher durch Zufall.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0964efeb-6171-4df3-88c8-2b57ba50657d",
                                "sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                                "text": "Es ist mitnichten so, dass ich meine Frau nicht liebe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4f9bd34-3749-48b0-8575-8b7109afa8e5",
                                "sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                                "text": "Der Nachbar zu unserer linken Seite ist mitnichten ein treuer Ehemann."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9417c17f-8e42-4cb3-a161-7259480d83c2",
                                "sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                                "text": "Dass alle Mädchen reinlich und ordentlich seien, trifft auf Elisa mitnichten zu."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7efc5d08-7042-49c5-bbb3-78eb76b98a28",
                        "source_entry_id": "1789c072-2c56-33f9-9011-ca54d613d4ac",
                        "source_sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                        "target_lang_word": "by no means",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "by no means",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                        "entry_id": "e2f725b2-deac-3699-b716-0da83251cb7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certainly not; definitely not; not at all."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d03f76fd-1377-414e-8310-a27e6e1dc12f",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "By no means am I suggesting that euthanasia should be outlawed, but rather that we should look at its inherent risks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27e0dcec-7703-4665-896e-779bddc8a253",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Is that all you’ve got to say? ―By no means. Let me explain further."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b863a6c1-5a8a-4b44-9615-46940639827a",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "For the Maine Garden, I doe not Deny, but there ſhould be ſome Faire Alleys, ranged on both Sides, vvith Fruit Trees; And ſome Pretty Tufts of Fruit Trees, And Arbours vvith Seats, ſet in ſome Decent Order; but theſe to be, by no Meanes, ſet too thicke; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc1586f7-0da5-4ef7-89bc-eda268224238",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "I was last night at the Funeral, where a confident lover in the play, speaking of his mistress, cries out—\"Oh that Harriot! to fold these arms about the waist of that beauteous, struggling, and at last yielding fair!\" Such an image as this ought by no means to be presented to a chaste and regular audience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e74d7acf-0078-45a1-943a-4aaeb0a1f2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Cecilia, thanking him for the offer, ſaid ſhe meant novv to make her acknovvledgments for all the trouble he had already taken, but by no means purpoſed to give him any more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "289a27a9-9b35-4f4a-9265-37569db57c20",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "It is by no means as the greatest of poets that Goethe deserves the pride and praise of his German countrymen. It is as the clearest, the largest, the most helpful thinker of modern times."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c62275f5-c106-44f7-86f7-6bf27759106b",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "[S]he was by no means tender-hearted or easily accessible to the feelings of others, like most country-bred people, who always retain in their souls something of the horny hardness of the paternal hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5e2b454-e9c2-48fe-abd3-5488c8079500",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "The compilers of the volume may very naturally have been tempted to strain a point so as to admit some specimen from the hand of the most potent if by no means the most perfect of English poetesses [Elizabeth Barrett Browning]: but in that case they would have done much better, in my humble opinion, to select the beautiful and simple memorial stanzas, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b465e54a-522d-4da9-bd18-20fa3614d0f0",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "He wrote to her the next day, sent her a five-pound note, and at the end of his letter said that if she were very nice and cared to see him for the week-end he would be glad to run down; but she was by no means to alter any plans she had made."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1c269d4-e16d-467f-a0a2-9f90ed69f21d",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Every photographer of experience has his own theories and methods of working, but for the last 14 years I have used a Leica exclusively, and have found it best adapted to the somewhat exacting demands of railway photography, which is by no means an easy branch of the art."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0956b9e-54b5-444e-b14e-4b1d0e742adc",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Well, during our short staycation at Humberston Fitties, just south of Cleethorpes, we cycled through the very unspoilt Lincolnshire Wolds, which are by no means flat and boring as conventional wisdom about the county suggests."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "279d1536-b9d1-4cf7-a00a-f12c3fd16fe5",
                        "source_entry_id": "1789c072-2c56-33f9-9011-ca54d613d4ac",
                        "source_sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                        "target_lang_word": "not at all",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "not at all",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86b2b8ba-7b29-3261-992a-0bcfae6731d4",
                                        "entry_id": "13cd7b52-1353-35ab-9faa-af4f635eb8e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not even a tiny bit; not in any way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "emphatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25bd2e97-9100-490e-90ce-eb3aa5bb9bd8",
                                                "sense_id": "86b2b8ba-7b29-3261-992a-0bcfae6731d4",
                                                "text": "He's not at all friendly towards his ex-wife."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6365ab1e-faed-4d2a-867f-b9ce60b6418b",
                                                "sense_id": "86b2b8ba-7b29-3261-992a-0bcfae6731d4",
                                                "text": "Now all this was very fine, but not at all in keeping with the Celebrity's character as I had come to conceive it. The idea that adulation ever cloyed on him was ludicrous in itself. In fact I thought the whole story fishy, and came very near to saying so."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "not at all",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "788865a7-9aa6-3b70-bb66-d83c18649c06",
                                        "entry_id": "a64618d1-9bd6-310a-97b2-0dafb2959a45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used similarly to you're welcome, as a conventional reply to an expression of gratitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28d09cce-6a33-453e-9735-af0558f857df",
                                                "sense_id": "788865a7-9aa6-3b70-bb66-d83c18649c06",
                                                "text": "—Thank you for coming. —Not at all. Thank you for having me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de233458-5be5-32bf-b158-ead8ca605629",
                                        "entry_id": "a64618d1-9bd6-310a-97b2-0dafb2959a45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Don't worry about it (response to worry or an apology)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e4257e5f-d8fb-4a0b-bacf-85044ef82945",
                        "source_entry_id": "1789c072-2c56-33f9-9011-ca54d613d4ac",
                        "source_sense_id": "9c51d2ea-7247-3edd-b154-9c3930858cd0",
                        "target_lang_word": "aucunement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aucunement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                        "entry_id": "afbca407-1a68-3078-a189-a92ce9997b02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En quelque façon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c9b6733-2388-42be-b13c-975cd87e628b",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "On peut dire de D. Raimond qu’il vient avec les députés d’Aragon dont il est parlé au premier acte, et qu’ainsi il satisfait aucunement à cette règle ; mais ce n’est que par hasard qu’il vient avec eux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc276806-c2aa-41f1-938b-982cc8fab4d8",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "L’heureux moment approche, où votre Deſtinée\nSemble être aucunement à la nôtre enchaînée,\nPuisque d’un droit d’aineſſe, incertain parmi nous,\nLa nôtre attend un Sceptre, & la vôtre, un Époux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4dee146-bc86-4e33-a7c8-e56883cbc299",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "S’il n’y mettoit seulement\nQue les gens du bas étage,\nOn pourroit aucunement\nSouffrir ce défaut aux hommes ;\nMais que tous tant que nous sommes\nNous mentions, grand et petit,\nSi quelque autre l’avoit dit,\nJe soutiendrois le contraire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a489c15b-2f00-471d-a5a3-c8fa0be07299",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "Le curé, messire Thomas,\nSut relever le fait ; et, comme l’on peut croire,\nEn confesseur exact il fit conter l’histoire,\nEt circonstancier le tout fort amplement,\nPour en connoître l’importance,\nPuis faire aucunement cadrer la pénitence,\nChose où ne doit errer un confesseur prudent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a18fd7b9-a08f-4276-8011-d82fcee22b85",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "Que dans un mot d’écrit nos pensers amoureux\nNous portent chaque jour et rapportent nos vœux,\nCharment aucunement l’ennui de notre absence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6d704d9-6951-428f-a9c7-2aad8369b1a8",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "Par maints propos, il [Courier] aurait essayé de troubler aucunement les gens de cour dans l’antique possession où ils sont de tout temps de partager entre eux les revenus publics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff9e41fe-50a9-46bd-b2b5-0da5efdbb778",
                                                "sense_id": "f6133e7e-3be7-38ae-903f-a7652f9bba54",
                                                "text": "Ainsi donc l’an 1536 les fidèles des vallées de Piémont, qui de tout temps ont eu en horreur le siége ^([sic]) romain, et toutefois par succession de temps avaient aucunement décliné de la piété et de la doctrine, envoyèrent à Genève vers Guillaume Farel, renommé pour sa doctrine et piété, deux personnages, l’un nommé Jean Girard, qui depuis a été imprimeur en ladite ville : et l’autre appelé Martin Gonin, lequel ayant été à son retour empoisonné à Grenoble, y fut noyé le 26 d’avril secrètement et de nuit à la persuasion de l’inquisiteur, après avoir tellement résisté aux adversaires de la vérité, qu’ils ne l’osèrent exécuter de jour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e66b04c0-ba25-3b2a-bfa3-1c114e92d83c",
                                        "entry_id": "afbca407-1a68-3078-a189-a92ce9997b02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En quelque façon (terme de palais)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8611650f-bd11-489e-874e-ae443b50e792",
                                                "sense_id": "e66b04c0-ba25-3b2a-bfa3-1c114e92d83c",
                                                "text": "La cour ayant aucunement égard à la demande du requérant. La cour ne rejetant ni n’admettant en totalité la demande"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cd31775-d8dd-3797-89e9-935f28d6a9f2",
                                        "entry_id": "afbca407-1a68-3078-a189-a92ce9997b02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En aucune façon, pas du tout. Utilisé avec ne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66c12b93-a189-49cc-a90c-f792c59a2a20",
                                                "sense_id": "7cd31775-d8dd-3797-89e9-935f28d6a9f2",
                                                "text": "Cette portion de l’île ne semblait avoir souffert aucunement de la rupture de l’isthme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b90b00e4-4670-449b-939a-a28fc6b394cd",
                                                "sense_id": "7cd31775-d8dd-3797-89e9-935f28d6a9f2",
                                                "text": "Bien que nous parlions de céréaliculteur , il faut se rappeler que l'exploitant de la Plaine ne pratique aucunement la monoculture des céréales. Si l'essentiel de son revenu est procuré par les grains, le reste provient de cultures industrielles, tel le colza, et de l’élevage rendu possible par l'extension des prairies artificielles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f6c9a1b-24d6-4fcf-b671-e5966b65ad5b",
                                                "sense_id": "7cd31775-d8dd-3797-89e9-935f28d6a9f2",
                                                "text": "Qu’un vain scrupule à ma flamme s’oppose,\nJe ne le puis souffrir aucunement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
